{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#card-zh","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-SkillSelect 是面向 DSH Web 的技能选择插件，在官方右侧栏提供 Skills 面板。它通过会话列表和技能服务展示已安装技能，支持按来源、仓库、名称和使用次数排序，并可搜索、勾选技能后把调用手势加入当前输入草稿。用户还可以配置自动启动技能、切换技能调用守卫、查看缓存或生成的技能简介，以及从面板更新技能。适合希望在每个 DSH 会话中挑选技能或管理常用技能的用户。需要 DSH Web 右侧栏；缺少简介时会使用 DSH 当前默认模型生成说明。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:527-550","lib/client.js:845-891","lib/index.js:675-741","lib/index.js:744-771"]}
{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#card-en","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-SkillSelect adds a Skills panel to the DSH Web sidebar. Find installed skills, sort by source, repository, name, or usage, and check them to add invocation gestures to the draft. Save defaults for automatic startup, limit calls with a guard, generate descriptions, or update skills.","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:527-550","lib/client.js:845-891","lib/index.js:675-741","lib/index.js:744-771"]}
