{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#feature-1","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-SkillSelect 的功能「会话技能勾选」：列出当前会话可用的技能并可搜索、分组浏览。勾选后将技能手势写入当前输入草稿，发送消息时由 DSH 加载技能内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:333-358","lib/client.js:527-550"]}
{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#feature-2","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-SkillSelect 的功能「自动启动」：把选定技能保存为默认名单。启用后，插件在会话首次收到用户消息时注入这些技能的说明内容。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:988-1008","lib/index.js:1142-1170"]}
{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#feature-3","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-SkillSelect 的功能「调用守卫」：可开启对 skill 工具调用的限制。模型只能调用默认启动或当前会话已勾选的技能，其他技能调用会被拒绝。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:897-915"]}
{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#feature-4","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-SkillSelect 的功能「技能简介」：优先显示技能已有的描述；缺失时可用 DSH 默认模型生成并缓存一句说明，也会从技能正文提取回退简介。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:744-771","lib/index.js:787-819"]}
{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#feature-5","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-SkillSelect 的功能「技能更新」：用户点击面板的 Update 后，插件尝试更新已安装技能目录，并在面板显示各项更新状态和变更摘要。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/client.js:538-549","lib/index.js:373-434"]}
{"unit_id":"wyzh0117__dsh-skill-select#caveat-1","repo":"wyzh0117/dsh-skill-select","commit":"42ab1c3014d9c00bb0235075d0304670f3c51e1d","type":"caveat","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-SkillSelect 使用前须知：点击 Update 会对技能目录执行 git pull，或按来源标记重新克隆并复制更新内容；技能文件可能随此操作改变（见 lib/index.js:373-434）。","source":"generated","evidence":["lib/index.js:373-434"]}
